<title>USA: FGIC QUALIFIES NEWARK USD, CALIF., FOR INSURANCE.</title>
<headline>FGIC QUALIFIES NEWARK USD, CALIF., FOR INSURANCE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Wednesday it qualified for municipal bond insurance, Newark Unified School District, Calif., $7.5 million general obligations for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
